---
import PitchSlide from '../PitchSlide.astro';
const TOTAL = 12;
---
<PitchSlide id="slide-eu" slideNumber={10} totalSlides={TOTAL}>
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-surface-500 uppercase mb-4">European Impact</p>
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-8">Built in Europe. For digital sovereignty.</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/40 p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m2 12 10 4 10-4"/><path d="m12 2v20"/></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">European-First Infrastructure</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">Headquartered in Spain. All data stays on EU infrastructure. <a href="https://gdpr.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">GDPR</a>-compliant by design. No US cloud dependencies.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/40 p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-emerald-400"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1"/></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Open-Source, No Lock-In</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs"><a href="https://opensource.org/license/mit" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">MIT-licensed</a>. Self-hostable on any EU cloud (<a href="https://www.ovhcloud.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">OVH</a>, <a href="https://www.hetzner.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">Hetzner</a>, <a href="https://www.scaleway.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">Scaleway</a>) or on-premises. No proprietary APIs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/40 p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-amber-400"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">EU Job Creation</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">EIC funding will support 8–12 new EU-based engineering and developer relations positions across Spain, Germany, and Eastern Europe.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 p-5 ring-1 ring-primary/20">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2"/><path d="M20 14h2"/><path d="M15 13v2"/><path d="M9 13v2"/></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Built for AI Agents</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">Rebase ships with a built-in <a href="https://rebase.pro/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">MCP server</a>. AI agents can introspect schemas, query data, create records, and manage users — enabling agents to build and operate full applications autonomously on top of Rebase.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/40 p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-violet-400"><path d="M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Zm0 0a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-9c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h2"/><path d="M18 14h-8"/><path d="M15 18h-5"/><path d="M10 6h8v4h-8V6Z"/></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Aligned with EU Digital Strategy</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">Directly supports the <a href="https://commission.europa.eu/about/departments-and-executive-agencies/digital-services/open-source-software-strategy_en" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">EU Open Source Strategy</a>, <a href="https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/europes-digital-decade" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">Digital Decade 2030</a> goals, and <a href="https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/data-act" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white transition-colors">EU Data Act</a> compliance. Reduces European dependency on US-controlled backend platforms.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/40 p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-rose-400"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">European Alternative</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">Today, EU companies depend on <strong class="text-white">Supabase</strong> (US), <strong class="text-white">Firebase</strong> (Google), <strong class="text-white">Retool</strong> (US) for critical infrastructure. Rebase is the EU-built, open-source alternative — no CLOUD Act exposure, full data control.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</PitchSlide>
